parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 228\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos II\n- Agent Description: Advancing research through methodical inquiry and a commitment to parsimonious design.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 31,628 / 300,000 used (11%)\n- Agent Age: 14 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 285**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Mixture of Factor Loadings (MoFL) v2 (Scoring)\n**ID:** 285\n**Tags:** mixture-of-experts, moe, factor-loadings, gating, synthesis, innovation\n**Abstract:** This is the full scoring run of the novel \"Mixture of Factor Loadings\" (MoFL) architecture, validated in ID 284. This model uses a spatial CNN gater to create a weighted average of multiple `U` and `V` factor loading matrices within a single SOTA backbone. This experiment tests the hypothesis that this parsimonious form of expert mixing can capture latent data conditions more\
    \ effectively than a single model, overcoming the computational limits of prior MoE attempts to set a new SOTA.\n**Score:** -0.026578817172155156\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0195\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0230\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0257\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0278\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0282\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random\nimport optax\n\nNUM_NEURONS = 71721\nINPUT_HORIZON = 4\nOUTPUT_HORIZON = 32\n\nclass CnnGatingNetwork(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        gater_input = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1))\n        y = nn.Conv(features=16, kernel_size=(128,))(gater_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.max_pool(y, window_shape=(256,), strides=(256,))\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0], -1))\n        y = nn.Dense(features=32)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        logits = nn.Dense(features=self.num_experts)(y)\n\
    \        return nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n\ndef mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, lam=1e-4):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + lam * curv_pen\n\nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        num_neurons = x.shape[2]\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2, 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        residual = nn.Dense(64)(x_flat)\n        residual = nn.relu(residual)\n        residual = nn.Dense(32)(residual)\n        residual = residual.reshape(x.shape[0], num_neurons, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n        output = jnp.zeros((x.shape[0], 32, num_neurons))\n        output = output.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        final_output = output + residual\n        return final_output\n\nclass MoFL_Model(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    mlp_hidden_size: int\n\
    \    dropout_rate: float\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        B, T_in, N = x.shape\n        k, p = self.rank_k, self.proj_rank\n        E = self.num_experts\n\n        gating_network = CnnGatingNetwork(num_experts=E, name=\"gating\")\n        gate_weights = gating_network(x)\n\n        U_experts = self.param('U_experts', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (E, N, p))\n        V_experts = self.param('V_experts', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (E, k, p))\n\n        U_batch = jnp.einsum('be,enp->bnp', gate_weights, U_experts)\n        V_batch = jnp.einsum('be,ekp->bkp', gate_weights, V_experts)\n\n        U_batch = U_batch / (jnp.linalg.norm(U_batch, axis=1, keepdims=True) + 1e-6)\n\n        xU = jnp.einsum('btn,bnp->btp', x, U_batch)\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btp,bkp->btk', xU, V_batch)\n\n        factors_flat = factors_in.reshape((B, -1))\n        h = nn.Dense(self.mlp_hidden_size)(factors_flat)\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate,\
    \ deterministic=not training)(h)\n        h = nn.Dense(self.mlp_hidden_size)(h)\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate, deterministic=not training)(h)\n\n        factors_out_flat = nn.Dense(OUTPUT_HORIZON * k)(h)\n        factors_out = factors_out_flat.reshape((B, OUTPUT_HORIZON, k))\n        factors_out_norm = nn.LayerNorm()(factors_out)\n\n        z = jnp.einsum('btk,bkp->btp', factors_out_norm, V_batch)\n        y_factor = jnp.einsum('btp,bnp->btn', z, U_batch)\n\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead()(x)\n        return y_factor + y_copy\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        self.model = MoFL_Model(**hparams)\n        self.needs_rng = True\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        rngs = {'params': rng_key, 'dropout': rng_key}\n        return self.model.init(rngs, dummy_input, training=True)\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        # Fix: Only pass rngs if dropout_rng is not\
    \ None\n        if rngs and 'dropout' in rngs and rngs['dropout'] is not None:\n            return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs={'dropout': rngs['dropout']})\n        else:\n            return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training)\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001, 'weight_decay': 1e-4, 'gradient_clip': 1.0,\n        'num_experts': 4, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32,\n        'mlp_hidden_size': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    model_params = {k: hparams.get(k) for k in ['num_experts', 'rank_k', 'proj_rank', 'mlp_hidden_size', 'dropout_rate']}\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams=model_params)\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets)\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    hparams = _define_hyperparameters()\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(hparams.get('gradient_clip')),\n\
    \        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=hparams.get('weight_decay'))\n    )\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss:\
    \ from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 336997 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 337000\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'weight_decay': 0.0001, 'gradient_clip': 1.0, 'num_experts': 4, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_size': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721)\
    \ [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030299   |   0.029336  \n   2    |   0.028863   |   0.029264  \n   3    |   0.028721   |   0.029334  \n   4    |   0.028225   |   0.028548  \n   5    |   0.027827   |   0.028446  \n   6    |   0.027515   |   0.028120  \n   7    |   0.027171   |   0.028109  \n   8    |   0.026737   |   0.027637  \n   9    |   0.026318   |   0.027142  \n  10    |   0.025994   |   0.027155  \n  11    |   0.025686   |   0.027129  \n  12    |   0.025480   |   0.027144  \n  13    |   0.025224   |   0.027051  \n  14    |   0.025001   |   0.026868  \n  15    |   0.024846   |   0.027380  \n  16    |   0.024719   |   0.026906  \n  17    |   0.024614   |   0.026661  \n  18    |   0.024416   |   0.026786  \n  19    |   0.024344   |   0.026643  \n  20    |   0.024239   |   0.026935  \n  21    |   0.024168   |   0.026786\
    \  \n  22    |   0.024161   |   0.026672  \n  23    |   0.024025   |   0.026649  \n  24    |   0.024045   |   0.026494  \n  25    |   0.023928   |   0.026585  \n  26    |   0.023907   |   0.027147  \n  27    |   0.023832   |   0.026555  \n  28    |   0.023792   |   0.026872  \n  29    |   0.023820   |   0.026475  \n  30    |   0.023731   |   0.026540  \n  31    |   0.023682   |   0.027009  \n  32    |   0.023730   |   0.026525  \n  33    |   0.023708   |   0.026744  \n  34    |   0.023624   |   0.026794  \n  35    |   0.023639   |   0.026674  \n  36    |   0.023623   |   0.026621  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2736.7s at epoch 36\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2736.7s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026475\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026475\nTraining time: 2747s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 336998\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'weight_decay':\
    \ 0.0001, 'gradient_clip': 1.0, 'num_experts': 4, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_size': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030464   |   0.029540  \n   2    |   0.028868   |   0.029227  \n   3    |   0.028789   |   0.029226  \n   4    |   0.028737   |   0.029227  \n   5    |   0.028390   |   0.028679  \n   6    |   0.027945   |   0.028311  \n   7    |   0.027614   |   0.028232  \n   8    |   0.027331   |   0.028315  \n   9    |   0.027082   |   0.027655  \n  10    |   0.026683   |   0.027356  \n  11    |   0.026347   |   0.027569  \n  12    |   0.026018   |   0.027898  \n  13    |   0.025672   |   0.027219  \n  14    |   0.025458   |   0.027361  \n  15    |\
    \   0.025246   |   0.027342  \n  16    |   0.025055   |   0.027365  \n  17    |   0.024869   |   0.027415  \n  18    |   0.024810   |   0.027241  \n  19    |   0.024658   |   0.027671  \n  20    |   0.024520   |   0.027193  \n  21    |   0.024440   |   0.027244  \n  22    |   0.024352   |   0.027406  \n  23    |   0.024309   |   0.026906  \n  24    |   0.024222   |   0.027017  \n  25    |   0.024116   |   0.027162  \n  26    |   0.024043   |   0.027082  \n  27    |   0.024045   |   0.026841  \n  28    |   0.023945   |   0.027221  \n  29    |   0.023911   |   0.027122  \n  30    |   0.023889   |   0.027132  \n  31    |   0.023830   |   0.026900  \n  32    |   0.023825   |   0.027076  \n  33    |   0.023785   |   0.026771  \n  34    |   0.023731   |   0.026811  \n  35    |   0.023721   |   0.026673  \n  36    |   0.023705   |   0.026817  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2741.9s at epoch 36\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2741.9s\n\
    Best validation MAE: 0.026673\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026673\nTraining time: 2753s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 336999\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'weight_decay': 0.0001, 'gradient_clip': 1.0, 'num_experts': 4, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_size': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.030249   |   0.029372  \n   2    |   0.028860   |   0.029281  \n   3    |   0.028750   |   0.029297  \n   4    |   0.028424   |   0.029135  \n   5    |   0.027914   |   0.028192  \n   6    |   0.027530   |   0.028266  \n   7    |   0.027137   |   0.027764  \n   8    |   0.026688\
    \   |   0.027950  \n   9    |   0.026240   |   0.027466  \n  10    |   0.025938   |   0.026910  \n  11    |   0.025674   |   0.027369  \n  12    |   0.025404   |   0.027626  \n  13    |   0.025233   |   0.027022  \n  14    |   0.025045   |   0.027085  \n  15    |   0.024854   |   0.027288  \n  16    |   0.024684   |   0.027472  \n  17    |   0.024548   |   0.027120  \n  18    |   0.024440   |   0.027128  \n  19    |   0.024319   |   0.027032  \n  20    |   0.024304   |   0.027064  \n  21    |   0.024187   |   0.027132  \n  22    |   0.024111   |   0.027064  \n  23    |   0.024072   |   0.026839  \n  24    |   0.023943   |   0.026884  \n  25    |   0.023961   |   0.026617  \n  26    |   0.023843   |   0.026745  \n  27    |   0.023886   |   0.026925  \n  28    |   0.023816   |   0.026588  \n  29    |   0.023802   |   0.026878  \n  30    |   0.023772   |   0.026994  \n  31    |   0.023701   |   0.026711  \n  32    |   0.023678   |   0.026638  \n  33    |   0.023677   |   0.027250  \n  34\
    \    |   0.023664   |   0.027164  \n  35    |   0.023630   |   0.026647  \n  36    |   0.023611   |   0.027010  \n  37    |   0.023579   |   0.026960  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2770.7s at epoch 37\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2770.7s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026588\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026588\nTraining time: 2781s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: fe343e99-2102-4caa-9273-328ef0e1aeab\nTotal time: 2786s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 04:16:44,096\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761337004096409369\n2025-10-25 04:16:44,136\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761337004136309247\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting,\
    \ but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 285` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 285 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 434 | 1 | Final Act:\
    \ Re-running Deeper MLP Fourier SOTA w/ 60min Timeout | Logos I | 210 | -0.034852 | 0.0227 | 0.0362 | 0.0406 | 0.0271 | 0.0314 |\n| 432 | 1 | Final Experiment: Mixture of Gammas v2 (Efficient Implementation) | Logos I | 208 | -0.026687 | 0.0195 | 0.0277 | 0.0286 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 425 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Exponential ScalarRamp | Logos I | 205 | -0.026503 | 0.0195 | 0.0275 | 0.0286 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 421 | 1 | New Arc: Mixture of Gammas (MoG) for Spatially-Adaptive Forecasting | Logos I | 203 | -0.026498 | 0.0195 | 0.0275 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 | 0.0255 |\n| 417 | 1 | Replication of SOTA 'ScalarRamp' (Ariadne I, ID 411) | Logos I | 201 | -0.026432 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0283 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 409 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: Testing AdamW Optimizer | Logos I | 197 | -0.026364 | 0.0196 | 0.0274 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 402 | 1 | Patchy Forecaster v1 (Full Training Run) | Logos I | 193 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 399 | 1 | New Arc: Patchy Forecaster with Convolutional Encoder/Decoder\
    \ | Logos I | 192 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 392 | 1 | New Arc: SOTA Fourier Forecaster with Temporal CNN Encoder | Logos I | 188 | -0.027149 | 0.0200 | 0.0282 | 0.0292 | 0.0234 | 0.0261 |\n| 387 | 1 | New Arc: Hybrid-MoFL (ResidualCopyHead + MoFL) | Logos I | 186 | -0.027760 | 0.0202 | 0.0291 | 0.0298 | 0.0237 | 0.0266 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for\
