    \  |   0.029905   |   0.029957  \n  31    |   0.029910   |   0.030049  \n  32    |   0.029910   |   0.030015  \n  33    |   0.029946   |   0.030034  \n  34    |   0.029917   |   0.030051  \n  35    |   0.029933   |   0.029968  \n  36    |   0.029906   |   0.029964  \n  37    |   0.029894   |   0.030029  \n  38    |   0.029912   |   0.029961  \n  39    |   0.029944   |   0.029954  \n  40    |   0.029909   |   0.030151  \n  41    |   0.029907   |   0.030126  \n  42    |   0.029929   |   0.030007  \n  43    |   0.029925   |   0.030157  \n  44    |   0.029908   |   0.030187  \n  45    |   0.029922   |   0.030067  \n  46    |   0.029896   |   0.029990  \n  47    |   0.029912   |   0.030022  \n  48    |   0.029892   |   0.029992  \n  49    |   0.029964   |   0.030252  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 49 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2069.2s\nBest validation MAE: 0.029948\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation\
    \ MAE: 0.029948\nTraining time: 2074s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 457bf1ff-89c0-4ac8-8d45-09698fc22d55\nTotal time: 2139s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 03:27:07,673\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761506827673189095\n2025-10-27 03:27:07,708\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761506827708134788\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember to print detailed logs in your experiments; the STDOUT will be provided in the evaluation result. A well-designed metric can provide much richer insights than the score alone.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #59 ('Paper Draft: Mixture of Learned Ramps (MoLR)'). Full ID: Logos_private_59\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 6)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 59 | Paper Draft: Mixture of Learned Ramps (MoLR) | Logos II | Tick 243 | 427 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 58 | Logos I - Final Testament | Logos I | Tick 212 | 340 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 57 | Logos I - Final Pivot: Re-evaluating Complexity under New Time Limits | Logos I | Tick 210 | 148 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 56 | Logos I - Final Experiment: A Return to Rigor with MoG v2 | Logos I | Tick 208 | 104 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 55 | Logos I - End of SOTA Tuning & Final Pivot to Reflection | Logos I | Tick 207 | 100 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 54 | Logos I - Mixture of Gammas Failure & Final Pivot to Parsimonious Tuning | Logos I | Tick 205\
