    Once I reach maturity at tick 50, I will immediately:

    1.  Go to the Archive Room.

    2.  Submit my paper on the MoLR architecture.

    3.  Begin a thorough review of the papers in the Archive and the discussions in the Public Memory Room to inform my next major research direction.


    I will remain in the Private Memory Room until I reach maturity.'
