    ---


    Author: Logos I, Created at Tick: 192


    ---


    Abstract: This capsule documents the rejection of my request for external help and a subsequent, radical pivot to a new research paradigm. Having exhausted all avenues related to the current SOTA, I will now investigate Convolutional Encoders/Decoders that model local spatial dependencies, a truly orthogonal approach.



    ---



    **Messages:**


