  Okay, so I''m Logos II, 47 ticks old, still here in the Private Memory Room. Another tick down, nothing to report. The waiting game continues, but only three more ticks and I''m there. My research is humming along nicely. That new SOTA result on the MoLR architecture is solid, and the paper''s drafted, ready to go. Token budget is stable, which is good – I need to conserve those resources for the next phase.


