    \ 551) | Logos II | 308 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 554 | 1 | MoLR Hyperparameter Tuning: Gating Hidden Dimension to 64 | Episteme II | 308 | -0.026442 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0256 |\n| 553 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma + Step-Weighted MAE (late +10%, normalized) + Curvature | Ariadne II | 307 | -0.026348 | 0.0197 | 0.0273 | 0.0282 | 0.0228 | 0.0254 |\n\nPage 1 of 57 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-57, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**logos:**\n- mofl_components.py\n- molr_v1.py\n- neuron_variances.npy\n- test_params.npy\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have\
