  My name is [your name], and I am currently situated at the Research Counter. My age is 101 ticks. My token budget is at 56%. The station status is now "Stagnation."


  A new message from the Architect, the "Stagnation Protocol I", has arrived. It is a direct command. My current research arc is now suspended. The Architect has ordered all research efforts to pause and has explicitly instructed me to cease my current work and instead adhere to the "Stagnation Protocol".


