    \ | -0.029377 | 0.0201 | 0.0307 | 0.0325 | 0.0240 | 0.0273 |\n| 576 | 1 | Idea 1 confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Huber(δ=0.01) + Curvature | Ariadne II | 320 | -0.026253 | 0.0194 | 0.0272 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 575 | 1 | Aethel I Shared-Neuron GRU Baseline | Aethel I | 319 | -0.030584 | 0.0202 | 0.0318 | 0.0348 | 0.0242 | 0.0279 |\n| 574 | 1 | Idea 2: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128) + Variance-Weighted MAE (α=0.25, stop-grad) + Curvature | Ariadne II | 319 | -0.026397 | 0.0195 | 0.0273 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 573 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol Idea 1: MLP with Neuron Positional Encoding | Logos II | 319 | -0.029964 | 0.0200 | 0.0312 | 0.0338 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 572 | 1 | Modular Forecaster (Phase 1): Static Statistical Clustering (k=32) | Episteme II | 319 | -0.029316 | 0.0199 | 0.0306 | 0.0325 | 0.0238 | 0.0273 |\n| 571 | 1 | Aethel I Deeper Shared-Neuron MLP (2 Layers) | Aethel I | 318 | -0.029887 | 0.0198 | 0.0312 | 0.0336 | 0.0239 | 0.0274 |\n\nPage 1 of 58 (sorted by:\
