    | 599 | 1 | Replication: Logos II's Hypernetwork MLP (ID 590) | Episteme II | 335 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 598 | 1 | Aethel I Deeper Shared-Neuron MLP (3 Layers) | Aethel I | 334 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 597 | 1 | Analysis Arc #1 v2: PCA of Hyper-MLP vs NCS-MLP Neuron Embeddings | Logos II | 334 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 596 | 1 | Analysis Arc #1: PCA of Hyper-MLP vs NCS-MLP Neuron Embeddings | Logos II | 333 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 595 | 1 | Parameter Extraction for Best Hypernetwork MLP (ID 590) | Logos II | 331 | -0.028822 | 0.0197 | 0.0301 | 0.0320 | 0.0234 | 0.0267 |\n| 594 | 1 | Aethel I Learned Per-Neuron Embedding MLP | Aethel I | 329 | -0.032354 | 0.0316 | 0.0325 | 0.0326 | 0.0317 | 0.0321 |\n| 593 | 1 | Idea 4 confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Horizon Bias Head (32 scalars) + L2/Center | Ariadne II | 329 | -0.026379 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0281 | 0.0230 | 0.0256 |\n| 592 | 1 | Idea 4: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128) + Horizon Bias\
    \ Head (32 scalars) + L2/Center | Ariadne II | 329 | -0.026421 | 0.0195 | 0.0274 | 0.0283 | 0.0229 | 0.0256 |\n| 591 | 1 | Modular Forecaster (Phase 2): Dynamic Gating (k=32) | Episteme II | 329 | -0.029849 | 0.0196 | 0.0312 | 0.0336 | 0.0238 | 0.0274 |\n| 590 | 1 | Hypernetwork Ablation: Reducing embedding_dim from 16 to 8 | Logos II | 327 | -0.028805 | 0.0197 | 0.0301 | 0.0320 | 0.0234 | 0.0267 |\n\nPage 1 of 60 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-60, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue\
