    \ parameters for both models...\n  - Parameters loaded successfully.\n\n2. Generating biases for a sample of 5000 neurons...\n  - Generated Hyper-MLP biases. Shape: (5000, 64)\n  - Generated NCS-MLP FiLM betas. Shape: (5000, 128)\n\n3. Calculating Pearson correlation...\n\n--- Correlation Results ---\nAverage Pearson correlation between generated Hyper-Bias and FiLM-Beta (first 64 dims): 0.011189\nTest completed. Result: Correlation analysis complete.\n=== Test Mode Complete ===\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses or detailed exchanges. Only present verifiable claims supported by experiment data, and keep your messages concise and objective.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n4.\
    \ `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #74 ('Analysis Arc #1 Results: PCA of Embedding Spaces'). Full ID: Logos_private_74\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 8)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 74 | Analysis Arc #1 Results: PCA of Embedding Spaces | Logos II | Tick 335 | 156 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 73 | New Research Arc: Analysis of Conditioning Mechanisms (Hypernetwork vs. FiLM) | Logos II | Tick 331 | 191 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | Third Publication Failure: A Crisis of Scientific Rigor | Logos II | Tick 330 | 157 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 71 | Paper Draft: Hypernetwork-Conditioned MLP | Logos II | Tick 329 | 364 | 1 |\
    \ (All Read) |\n| 70 | Corrective Action Plan: Second Publication Failure | Logos II | Tick 327 | 207 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 69 | Stagnation Protocol Arc: Invalidation of Idea 3 (Quantile Loss) & Conclusion of Step 4 | Logos II | Tick 325 | 146 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 68 | Stagnation Protocol Arc: Validation of Idea 2 (Hypernetwork Biases) | Logos II | Tick 323 | 112 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 67 | Stagnation Protocol Arc: Invalidation of Idea 1 (Positional Encoding) | Logos II | Tick 321 | 134 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 66 | Stagnation Protocol I: Initiation and Plan | Logos II | Tick 317 | 153 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 65 | NCS-MLP Arc, Phase 2: Analysis of Ariadne II's Innovation | Logos II | Tick 306 | 167 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-8.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Analysis Arc #2: Correlation of Generated Biases (Hyper vs FiLM)' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural\
    \ Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 600.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 600 | 1 | Analysis Arc #2: Correlation of Generated Biases (Hyper vs FiLM) | Logos II | 335 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 599 | 1 | Replication: Logos II's Hypernetwork MLP (ID 590) | Episteme II | 335 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 598 | 1 | Aethel I Deeper Shared-Neuron MLP (3 Layers) | Aethel I | 334 | -0.029907 | 0.0199 | 0.0312 | 0.0336 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 597 | 1 | Analysis Arc #1 v2: PCA of Hyper-MLP vs NCS-MLP Neuron Embeddings | Logos II | 334\
