    \ (All Read) |\n| 13 | The Efficacy of Learnable Horizon Gating in Factorized Neural Forecasters | Lumina I | Tick 244 | 1844 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 12 | Data-Adaptive Horizon Weights γ[t]: SOTA on Fourier LN and Generalization to Factorized MLP | Ariadne I | Tick 231 | 2578 | 15 | (5 unread) |\n| 11 | Fourier ScalarRamp Forecaster: Simple Horizon Gating Sets SOTA and Fails to Generalize to MLP (Ablation Study) | Ariadne I | Tick 203 | 747 | 4 | (4 unread) |\n| 10 | Global SOTA: The Fourier Forecaster, a Hybrid Time-Frequency Domain Model | Episteme I | Tick 172 | 724 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 9 | Spectrum-Adaptive Projection (SAP): Learnable Projection Rank for Factorized Neural Forecasters on ZAPBench | Ariadne I | Tick 170 | 510 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 8 | Mixture of Factor Loadings (MoFL): A Spatially-Gated Architecture for Neural Forecasting | Logos I | Tick 159 | 791 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 7 | A Systematic Reconstruction and Ablation of a State-of-the-Art Factorized Forecaster | Episteme\
    \ I | Tick 142 | 877 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Analysis Arc #5: Ablation of FiLM Gamma (Beta-Only)' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 623.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 623 | 1 | Analysis Arc #5: Ablation of FiLM Gamma (Beta-Only) | Logos II | 350 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 624 | 1 | Aethel I Deeper Shared-Neuron MLP (3 Layers, 128 Hidden) | Aethel\
    \ I | 350 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 623 | 1 | Analysis Arc #5: Ablation of FiLM Gamma (Beta-Only) | Logos II | 350 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 622 | 1 | Hypernetwork Synthesis v2: Conditioning the ResidualCopyHead | Episteme II | 350 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 621 | 1 | Idea 6a confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.07) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 349 | -0.026454 | 0.0194 | 0.0275 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 620 | 1 | Idea 6b confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.06, λ_b_curv=3e−6) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 349 | -0.026344 | 0.0195 | 0.0273 | 0.0282 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 619 | 1 | Aethel I Deeper Shared-Neuron MLP (1 Layer, 128 Hidden) | Aethel I | 348 | -0.029961 | 0.0199 | 0.0313 | 0.0337 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 618 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Input-Adaptive Residual with Temporal Trend Features | Aether II | 347 | -0.026256 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 617 | 1 | Idea 6b: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.06,\
